SUMMARY:Social Club 150 One Year Anniversary Party
DESCRIPTION:Join us at our first SUPER SOCIAL in celebration of the Club’s One Year Anniversary. \nSuper Socials bring everyone from across all Chapters together – members\, friends of the club\, waitlisters\, and anyone who is curious about Social Club 150. \nLots of mingle time\, food\, cash bar\, conversation\, dancing\, play. Our official private party time is 6:30-8:30 (bed by 10pm or you can stay and play\, the club is open til late).
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/social-club-150-one-year-anniversary-party/
LOCATION:The Vatican Gift Shop\, 1047 Gerrard St E\, Toronto\, M4M 1Z7
